{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53182","headline":"诗偈 七 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"富儿空毛行，贫儿把他物。\n被物牵入廛，买卖不得出。\n觉暮便归舍，黄昏黑漆漆。\n所求不称意，合家加啾唧。\n自无般若性，乏欠波罗蜜。\n把绳入草里，自系百年毕。\n实是可怜许，冥冥不见日。\n富儿虽空手，家中甚富溢。\n自有无尽藏，不假外缘物。\n周流用不穷，要者从理出。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53182.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53182","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}